      image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6d296ae854b2bf449ba83e5ffc984ec7, type: 3}
      text: 
    - caption: "\uC6C5\uD06C\uB9B0 \uB300\uAE30\xB7\uAC77\uAE30 \u2014 Adobe Mixamo \uC6D0\uBCF8 \u2192 Blender \uBCF4\uC815(\uBAB8 \uBE44\uD2C0\uB9BC \uC81C\uAC70\xB7\uC6C5\uD06C\uB9BC \uAE4A\uC774\xB7\uD314\xB7\uBC1C \uACE0\uC815)"
      image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 611299963a377c14ab60f765dbb94ed8, type: 3}
      text: 
